# =====================================================================
# elevateaisystem.com — Cloudflare Pages redirects & rewrites
# =====================================================================

# 1. Canonical domain — force www (301 permanent)
# This ensures Google treats www.elevateaisystem.com as the single canonical domain.
https://elevateaisystem.com/* https://www.elevateaisystem.com/:splat 301

# 2. Pretty-URL rewrites for marketing pages (clean, no .html)
# NOTE: only list ALIASES here — pages whose source filename differs from the URL.
# Pages handles /foo → /foo.html automatically when the filename matches the URL.
# Adding a redundant rule for those collides with Pages' built-in clean-URL handler
# and can cause loops. Only /free-map is a true alias to a different filename.
/free-map            /your-map.html            200

# 3. Portal pretty-URLs (auth-gated in the browser via Supabase)
# NOTE: Cloudflare can't enforce auth on static files. These rewrites just make
# URLs clean. The actual access gate is in each portal page's JS — it calls
# supa.auth.getSession() and redirects to /portal/login if no session, and then
# checks the cohort_members table to confirm paid status before rendering.
/portal              /portal/login.html        200
/portal/             /portal/login.html        200
/portal/login        /portal/login.html        200
/portal/dashboard    /portal/dashboard.html    200
/portal/week-1       /portal/week-1.html       200
/portal/week-2       /portal/week-2.html       200
/portal/week-3       /portal/week-3.html       200
/portal/week-4       /portal/week-4.html       200
/portal/week-5       /portal/week-5.html       200
/portal/week-6       /portal/week-6.html       200
/portal/week-7       /portal/week-7.html       200
/portal/week-8       /portal/week-8.html       200
/portal/your-drop    /portal/your-drop.html    200

# 4. Legacy Sprint $497 page → deprecated, send to cohort
/sprint              /augmented-coach          301
/sprint.html         /augmented-coach          301

# 5. Coach Platform page consolidation (May 2026)
# Old long-form coach-platform.html was archived to coach-platform-archived-2026-05.html
# (kept on disk for reference, NOT linked from anywhere). The new simple entry page
# (formerly /start) is now the canonical /coach-platform. Redirect /start → /coach-platform.
/start               /coach-platform           301
/start.html          /coach-platform           301
